    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Zero</strong> immerses you in an adrenaline-fueled, fast-paced first-person shooter experience designed for up to <strong>16 players per match</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Six diverse game modes</strong>: Team Death Match, Free For All, Capture The Flag, Gun Game, Elimination, and Bomb Defusal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fluid, responsive controls</strong> and smooth movement mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wide range of weapons</strong> for customized loadouts. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/d85ec0b7c67738f4d2e2467c2610bf0e.avif?t=1745569136\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Solo or team-based gameplay</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI opponents</strong> to play against when no online players available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training mode</strong>\u00a0to test weapons and experiment with mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive tutorial</strong>\u00a0to learn the basic movement<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Six maps\u00a0</strong>to explore and battle on. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.poster.avif?t=1745569136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.webm?t=1745569136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.mp4?t=1745569136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fluid, responsive controls and smooth movement mechanics that let you run, jump, walk and slide with ease. With a wide range of weapons to choose from, players can customize their loadouts to suit their individual playstyle and dominate the competition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer to go solo or work with your team, Project Zero offers exciting and competitive gameplay that will keep you coming back for more. With <strong>ongoing updates and new content</strong>, there's always something new to discover in this first-person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate test of skill and strategy in Project Zero, where every move counts and every shot can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Accees Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Zero is in Beta/Early Access stage. Some features might not work correctly, and this version of the game might be unstable at times.</i></p>",
